"  3. Search for simpler transition function" println
"  4. Synthesize optimized version" println
"" println

"Example:" println
"  Slow: recursive fibonacci (exponential)" println
"  Fast: iterative fibonacci (linear)" println
"  Trace reveals: we recompute the same values → memoize or iterate" println
